 "Your data stays yours": "Tvoji podatki ostanejo tvoji",
 "Liftr has no account, no server and no advertising. Your workouts, exercises, routines, body measurements and gym pass are stored on your device and in your own private iCloud.": "Liftr nima računa, strežnika ali oglasov. Tvoji treningi, vaje, načrti, telesne mere in fitnes kartica so shranjeni v tvoji napravi in v tvojem zasebnem iCloudu.",
 "Only with your permission, Liftr reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate, and saves workouts, calories, distance and weight. Health data never leaves your devices through Liftr and is never used for advertising. You can change access at any time in the Health app.": "Samo s tvojim dovoljenjem Liftr bere tvojo težo, telesno sestavo in srčni utrip v mirovanju ter shranjuje treninge, kalorije, razdaljo in težo. Zdravstveni podatki prek Liftr nikoli ne zapustijo tvojih naprav in se nikoli ne uporabljajo za oglaševanje. Dostop lahko kadar koli spremeniš v aplikaciji Zdravje.",
 "iCloud": "iCloud",
 "Syncing between your iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch goes through your private iCloud database. The developer cannot see this data. The code of your gym pass is end-to-end encrypted.": "Sinhronizacija med tvojim iPhonom, iPadom in Apple Watch poteka prek tvoje zasebne zbirke podatkov iCloud. Razvijalec teh podatkov ne vidi. Koda tvoje fitnes kartice je šifrirana od konca do konca.",
 "Camera and photos": "Kamera in fotografije",
 "The camera and your photos are only used to read the code of your gym pass. Images are not saved or sent anywhere.": "Kamera in tvoje fotografije se uporabljajo samo za branje kode tvoje fitnes kartice. Slike se ne shranjujejo in se nikamor ne pošiljajo.",
 "Notifications": "Obvestila",
 "Reminders and the rest timer are planned on your device. There is no push server.": "Opomniki in časovnik počitka se načrtujejo v tvoji napravi. Strežnika za potisna obvestila ni.",
 "No tracking": "Brez sledenja",
 "Liftr contains no analytics, no third-party code and no tracking of any kind.": "Liftr ne vsebuje analitike, kode tretjih oseb ali kakršnega koli sledenja.",
 "Deleting your data": "Brisanje tvojih podatkov",
 "Delete workouts in the app. To remove everything, delete Liftr and remove its data in Settings → your name → iCloud → Manage Storage.": "Treninge izbriši v aplikaciji. Če želiš odstraniti vse, izbriši Liftr in njegove podatke v Nastavitve → tvoje ime → iCloud → Upravljaj shrambo.",
 "Privacy": "Zasebnost",
 "Liftr is built to keep your training private.": "Liftr je narejen tako, da tvoj trening ostane zaseben.",
 "Questions?": "Vprašanja?",
 "Last updated: November 2026": "Nazadnje posodobljeno: november 2026",
 "Waiting for internet": "Čakanje na internet",
 "iCloud storage is full": "Prostor v iCloudu je poln",
 "iCloud isn't set up yet": "iCloud še ni nastavljen",
 "iCloud is busy. Liftr tries again automatically; your workouts are safe on this device.": "iCloud je trenutno zaseden. Liftr bo samodejno poskusil znova; tvoji treningi so varni v tej napravi.",
 "Your workouts sync as soon as you're online again.": "Tvoji treningi se bodo sinhronizirali, ko boš spet na spletu.",
 "Free up space in iCloud to keep syncing. Your workouts are safe on this device.": "Sprosti prostor v iCloudu, da se sinhronizacija nadaljuje. Tvoji treningi so varni v tej napravi.",
 "This version of Liftr can't save to iCloud yet. Your workouts are safe on this device and sync once this is fixed.": "Ta različica Liftra še ne more shranjevati v iCloud. Tvoji treningi so varni v tej napravi in se bodo sinhronizirali, ko bo to odpravljeno.",
